__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# Generated at runtime by database/migrate_csv_to_db.py - not source of truth
database/app.db

# Unrelated datasets, not used by any code in this repo
data/raw/olist_orders_dataset.csv
data/raw/olist_order_payments_dataset.csv

# Self-registered tenants' training data + model artifacts (api/training.py) -
# generated at runtime per tenant, not source of truth, unlike the committed
# demo tenants' model dirs below (which stay tracked). Three more self-
# registered tenants are ALSO permanently committed, same as Telco/Banking:
# aurora-streaming, meridian-wireless, and fernwood-retail-collective are
# real regression fixtures multiple tests depend on directly (genuinely
# different column names/id columns/missing-module cases - see e.g.
# tests/test_business_impact.py's AURORA_MODEL_DIR comment) - a fresh
# checkout/CI run needs these artifacts to actually exist on disk, the same
# way it needs models/v1 to. Every OTHER self-registered tenant (created ad
# hoc by tests, demos, or real onboarding) stays gitignored/runtime-only.
data/tenant_uploads/*
!data/tenant_uploads/aurora-streaming.csv
!data/tenant_uploads/meridian-wireless.csv
!data/tenant_uploads/fernwood-retail-collective.csv
models/*
!models/v1
!models/v1_enriched
!models/v2
!models/banking_v1
!models/aurora-streaming
!models/meridian-wireless
!models/fernwood-retail-collective

# Secrets - real GEMINI_API_KEY goes in .env (gitignored), never in .env.example
.env
.env.local

# Real (if demo-only) plaintext account passwords - never committed/pushed.
# See CREDENTIALS.md itself: the Meridian Wireless password is explicitly
# flagged there as needing rotation before this project leaves local dev -
# now that it's actually being deployed, keeping this file out of version
# control entirely is the safer default rather than relying on remembering
# to rotate it later.
CREDENTIALS.md
